Description: terminal-based USD (Universal Scene Description) viewer
 usdless renders 3D USD scenes as coloured Unicode art directly in your
 terminal using Hydra's rendering pipeline. It supports half-block and
 Braille rendering modes with 24-bit ANSI colour, an interactive TUI with
 scene-tree navigation, PBR material approximation, and multithreaded
 CPU rasterisation.
